+From a0a98af122a5014a279140191973e375250a6eb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: sahbot <support.opensource@softathome.com>
+Date: Fri, 13 Dec 2024 13:57:23 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] fix: Fix using wrong reset_hard command (PPW-206)
+
+Problem: The code was using the reset_hard command even when reset_hard
+is not available
+
+Solution:
+- Only use reset_hard if this script is available.
+- Split the config variables in a different odl called tr181-device_vars.odl
+
+Issue: PPW-206 - Device.FactoryReset() returns success but device is not factory resetting
+Signed-off-by: Lucas Vecchete <lucas.vecchete@softathome.com>
+---
+ baf.yml                                       |  8 ++---
+ include_priv/device.h                         |  4 +++
+ makefile                                      |  3 ++
+ makefile.inc                                  |  4 ---
+ mod-debug-info/src/mod_debug_info_start.c     |  1 -
+ odl/tr181-device.odl                          |  9 +----
+ odl/tr181-device_vars.odl                     | 10 ++++++
